          "description": "Revises this agent's earlier proposed centimetre contract to match the user-edited conversion requirement in context revision 2. Caller supplies finite nonnegative number primitive in millimetres, receives metres by IEEE-754 division by 1000; all other inputs throw TypeError. Synchronous, stateless, no identity, I/O, retries or remote timeout. No live gauge adapter is supplied. Historical snapshots and accepted/user/imported records are retained.",
